flowchart LR
    subgraph PhoneA["Phone A (speaker)"]
        MicA[AudioRecord] --> RecA[Recognizer.java\ngRPC stream]
    end

    RecA -->|audio chunks| STT[Google Cloud\nSpeech-to-Text API]
    STT -->|transcript| TransA[Translation API call]
    TransA -->|translated text| BTA[ConversationBluetoothCommunicator]

    BTA <-->|Bluetooth\nBluetoothCommunicator lib| BTB[ConversationBluetoothCommunicator]

    subgraph PhoneB["Phone B (listener)"]
        BTB --> TTS[Android TextToSpeech]
    end

    KeyFile[User-supplied GCP\nservice-account key] -.OAuth2 token.-> RecA
    KeyFile -.OAuth2 token.-> TransA
